<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="d1" name="Key NFRs"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="820" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Exercise 1 - Key Qualities (Non-Functional Requirements)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="8" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value='&lt;table border="1" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;"&gt;&lt;tr style="background:#dae8fc;font-weight:bold"&gt;&lt;td&gt;Quality&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Requirement / mechanism&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Target / measure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Cognito JWT + tenant claim; credentials redacted/never stored; prompt-injection blocked; KMS everywhere; permissions boundary; least-privilege IAM; auth outside the model&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;100% credential messages rejected before agent (SC-002)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compliance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;KYC gate before products; AML flagging; fail closed when no authoritative KYC provider; risk disclosure; no guaranteed returns&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;100% market recs have risk assessment (SC-001)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Availability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Managed serverless services; DLQ for events; graceful CRM/KB degradation; session recovery from DynamoDB&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;99.9% monthly API availability (proposed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bounded context/memory top-k, tool filtering, timeouts + bounded retries&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;API p95 &lt; 1,000 ms (proposed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Data integrity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Typed workflow state, atomic patches, optimistic revisions, idempotency keys&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Rejected patch preserves prior state (SC-010)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy / Retention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Tenant-scoped memory namespaces; no client-data memory writes until approved; 7-day masked logs; erasure operation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;30-day short-term event expiry&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Observability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Structured redacted logs, X-Ray tracing, CloudWatch alarms -&gt; encrypted SNS topic, sensitive-log findings metric&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Alarm on 5xx &gt; 1%, Lambda errors/throttles&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maintainability / Extensibility&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Shared framework + manifest-driven agents; CDK constructs; Ruff, typing, pytest, Hypothesis, CDK assertions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;New agent without framework/CDK changes (SC-016)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deployability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;CDK v2, 4 stacks, deterministic synth, OIDC federated deploy, cdk diff review, RETAIN + termination protection in prod&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;No long-lived keys (FR-031)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scalability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Pay-per-request DynamoDB, Lambda, AgentCore Runtime sessions; multi-tenant&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;High-value retail &amp; wealth clients&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="60" width="1340" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>